  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Intelligence: UK Trade Partnerships Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Kingdom Trade Partnerships (UKTP) Programme aims to increase trade from African, Caribbean and Pacific countries (ACP) to the United Kingdom (UK) and the European Union (EU) by maximizing the benefits of Economic Partnership Agreements (EPAs). The UKTP Programme works in partnership with vernment agencies, private sector organisations, public sector institutions, small and medium-sized enterprises and other local stakeholders, to support access and use of trade intelligence.</narrative>
  </description>
